// src/smoke/ShellSmokeScreen.jsx — SMOKE ONLY, NEVER MERGE.
//
// The two-view shell (spec docs/specs/RESEARCH_MODAL_SHELL_SPEC_V1.md §8, after
// Build C's smoke, its spec §8): the research modal on a phone, from committed
// JSON fixtures shaped from real battle documents (the measured position
// generated by the real corrected-battle harness, scorer and committed patch —
// Build C's own fixtures; no battle, user, agent or chat record is read).
//
//   ?sheetFixture=held_tf | held_cp | held_legacy | bench_incumbent | unexamined | budget_out | held_redzone | browse_ceg
//   + the questions and the Battle chart (build prompt of Nov 13, 2026): held_up (AAPL, up from entry —
//     Should we take profit?) | held_down (EQIX, the weakest — Is this our weakest spot?) | bench_book
//     (MSFT on the bench — Is this better than our weakest holding?) | battle_3day (30-minute bars) |
//     battle_1day_six (5-minute bars, six record markers on one day). Six measured stocks from the real
//     corrected-battle harness (sheetFixtures.book.json); the agent is stored as "shadow".
//
// EVERY PRICE ON THE PAGE COMES FROM THE FIXTURES (Nov 13): the quote, series and profile routes are
// answered here; every other /api/ route is refused (the Ranks and Sector tabs' rankings routes included),
// and every cached ohlcv_ entry is cleared before the modal mounts, so no real price reaches the chart.
//
// The battle states mount the real AssetResearchModal exactly as the Battle
// View's shipped mount does — with the sheetContext the screen builds and, as
// with Bomb mode 'on' in production, its bombContext (so the 💣 pill shows;
// `?bomb=0` drops it). `held_redzone` (FQ-9): AAPL at $103.40, 0.36 % under +30
// with the market open — the modal opens on 💣. `browse_ceg`: Constellation
// Energy from search — no battle, no partner — with the watchlist action
// (WatchlistContainer's mount: "Add to Watchlist").
//
// THE CLOCK is the fixture's instant (Wed Oct 14 2026, 1:07 PM ET). Series,
// quotes and profiles are answered here from generated data. THE ASK IS
// ANSWERED HERE by a canned reply marked SMOKE ONLY (no model call, no budget
// charged anywhere), and WHAT'S MOVING by a canned explanation marked SMOKE ONLY
// (no provider call). The Ranks, Smart Money and Sector tabs are today's
// components and read what they read today: public market data only (the
// /api/stocks/peer-rankings and /api/stocks/sector-rankings routes and the
// read-if-true market documents indexIntelligence/stockRankings,
// stockTechnicalScores/{SYM}, institutionalHoldings/{SYM}) — read-only, so the
// founder sees their real content.
//
// MEASUREMENT PARAMETERS (SMOKE ONLY): ?name=… the agent's name; ?arch=… the
// archetype; ?long=1 a long sentence, idea and directive; ?bomb=0 no Bomb mode;
// ?delay=N series N ms late; ?fail=1 every series fails.

